<div id="article_show_text">I released the fifth preview release of Rawtherapee 1.1. Thanks for the many test reports, it is getting more stable every day.<br />
I also provide a linux version from this release. This is a kind of
release candidate, if there are no major problems, this will be the
final 1.1.<br />
I already started to work on version 1.2, which has three aims: SPEED, SPEED and SPEED :)</div>

